          <li>Mailbox passwords are Fernet-encrypted and never returned by the API</li>
          <li>Duplicate ingest blocked by unique (email_account_id, imap_uid)</li>
          <li>Failed sends are persisted as FAILED rows with a sanitized error</li>
          <li>Auto-replies are not counted as replies in dashboard metrics</li>
